<http://data.silknow.org/object/d9542e1c-65af-3fac-b41b-a2c6c0a8fdbf>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric, woven silk twill.\nDisplayed behind glass. \n2\\2 twill.\nWarp: white, red and brown silk with white silk used as a binding warp; the binding warp ties the wefts at the back.\nWeft: white silk as the main warp and blue, faded green, yellow, orange and black silk as pattern wefts.\nStripes: narrow blue ground with a yellow meandering stem with faint red and yellow blossoms.  The wider stripes have a white ground with truncated horizontal stems, one ending in a round green and red bud.  There are small red or yellow flowers and blossoms."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/cedeca35-f6ce-35bc-8c00-1ba67ce2c9ba> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric, woven silk twill.\nDisplayed behind glass. \n2\\2 twill.\nWarp: white, red and brown silk with white silk used as a binding warp; the binding warp ties the wefts at the back.\nWeft: white silk as the main warp and blue, faded green, yellow, orange and black silk as pattern wefts.\nStripes: narrow blue ground with a yellow meandering stem with faint red and yellow blossoms.  The wider stripes have a white ground with truncated horizontal stems, one ending in a round green and red bud.  There are small red or yellow flowers and blossoms."@en ;
